          "quote": "魏故使持節假黃鉞侍中太傅大司馬尚書令定州刺史廣陽文獻王銘。",
          "role": "spouse_title_identification"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-epitaph-yuanzhan",
          "book_id": "b-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts",
          "chapter_id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts",
