          "paragraph_id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p002",
          "quote": "公諱湛，字士深，河南洛陽人也。",
          "role": "spouse_title_identification"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-epitaph-yuanzhan",
          "book_id": "b-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts",
          "chapter_id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts",
          "source_id": "s-epitaph-yuanzhan-daitof00794",
          "paragraph_id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p003",
          "quote": "春秋卅有五，以武定二年歲在甲子五月十四日丁酉薨於鄴。",
          "role": "burial_year_context"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-epitaph-yuanzhan",
          "book_id": "b-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts",
          "chapter_id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts",
          "source_id": "s-epitaph-yuanzhan-daitof00794",
          "paragraph_id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p004",
          "quote": "王如故，謚曰文獻，禮也。粵以其年八月庚申葬於武城之北原。",
          "role": "matching_burial_attestation"
        },
        {
          "work_id": "w-epitaph-yuanzhan",
          "book_id": "b-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts",
          "chapter_id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts",
          "source_id": "s-epitaph-yuanzhan-daitof00794",
          "paragraph_id": "c-epitaph-yuanzhan-excerpts:p005",
          "quote": "芒阜臨北，魚山望東，安厝不異，託葬攸同。",
          "role": "shared_burial_wording"
        }
      ],
      "interpretation_note": "王妃誌直載夫號、王令媛姓名，並明言合葬。元湛誌題為同一廣陽文獻王，名湛、字士深，誌載同日同地入葬，銘辭稱託葬攸同，未直書妃名。婚期與子女未見明載。",
